+
+## 2026-10-04 - Isolated setup handoff review
+
+The central agent installed the canonical package and handed the checkout to
+an independent Instance agent. The Instance agent read the root bridge,
+control-plane index, managed guide and operating rules, routing policy,
+local development rules, and installation handoff. Seeded the five required
