+
+The starting upstream commit was
+`edaef74233b75708ea4354e3e15793f195567e34`. `origin` points to the operator's
+fork, and `upstream` points to its original parent. Host-specific evidence
+and private patch locations remain in ignored `../local/HOST.md`.
+
+Independent verification:
+
+- All 13 original product files other than `.gitignore` matched the saved
+  SHA-256 hashes; `.gitignore` retained its original entry and only appended
