+# Agent Startup - RAIDEN Instance
+
+Read `.raiden/README.md`, `.raiden/state/CURRENT_STATE.md`,
+`.raiden/state/OPEN_LOOPS.md`, and `.raiden/writ/AGENTS.md` before work.
+
+## Constraints
+
+- Do not write `.raiden/writ/`; it is RAIDEN-managed core.
+- Instance-owned adaptations belong in `.raiden/local/`; continuity belongs
+  in `.raiden/state/`.
+- D-0016: update managed core, preserve local overlay, preserve live state,
+  and stop and report on locally modified managed files.
+- Stop before distribution into a dirty target or crossing a role boundary.
